Your child, {{user.name.first}}, has registered on <a href="https://{{user.origin}}">turn2opinion</a>, an online survey and market research panel platform published by Frequent Research Fieldwork Solutions Pvt. Ltd. As they have indicated that they are under the age of 18.
</p>

<p
      style="
        font-size: 17px;
