      "
    >
<a href="https://{{user.origin}}">
turn2opinion
</a> 
allows members to participate in surveys and earn rewards by sharing opinions on various topics. We are committed to maintain a safe and secure environment for all participants, especially minors.
</p>
<h3>
  Why You Are Receiving This Email
</h3>

<p
      style="
        font-size: 17px;
        color: #2a3940;
        
        margin: 20px 0;
      "
    >
During registration, your child provided your email address as the {{user.parent.relation}}. In accordance with our Child Protection and Privacy Policy, we require verified parental approval before allowing access to our platform.
</p>
<h3>
  What We Collect
</h3>

<p
      style="
        font-size: 17px;
        color: #2a3940;

        margin: 20px 0;
