  <li>
     Survey participation responses
  </li>
  <li>
     Reward-related details (if applicable)
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>
  Your Rights as a Parent/Guardian
</h3>

<p
      style="
        font-size: 17px;
        color: #2a3940;
        
        margin: 20px 0;
      "
    >
You have the right to:
</p>
<ul style="color: #2a3940;">
  <li>
