  </li>
  <li>
    Withdraw consent at any time {% comment %} by making a request on <a mailto:support@{{user.origin}}>support@{{user.origin}}</a> {% endcomment %}
  </li>
  <li>
    Request account deletion {% comment %} by generating a support ticket or writing email to <a mailto:support@{{user.origin}}>support@{{user.origin}}</a> {% endcomment %}
  </li>
    <li>
      Contact us for any clarification 
    </li>
  
  </ul>
  <p
      style="
        font-size: 17px;
